## Commands Executed

### 1. Install Git (if necessary)

    sudo dnf install -y git

### 2. Clone the Repository

    git clone [YOUR REPOSITORY URL]

### 3. Navigate Into the Repository

    cd [YOUR REPOSITORY NAME]

### 4. List the Module 1 Directory

    ls module1

